{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Like smoke driven</b> — a complete tanduf form comes, like: 'and all your images I will drive' (תנגושו)." "<b>Like wax melting</b> — the verb is from the doubled-root (פעלי הכפל) forms." "<b>Wax</b> — שעוה." "<b>The wicked perish</b> — they are those who wage war against David."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 68, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:02.889190381Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}